 "title": "GPT-6 Astra availability and compute limits for ChatGPT Plus",
 "summary": "OpenAI announced that GPT-6 Astra is available to ChatGPT Plus users but not as a standard chat model. It is accessible via ChatGPT Work and Codex with limited compute budgets. Users have approximately 3-30 local messages per 5-hour window, with a weekly undisclosed limit. After exhaustion, credits can be purchased without upgrading to Pro.",
